  "status": "draft",
  "text": "Each sport has its place: football and rugby are played on a pitch (a field); basketball, volleyball, handball and tennis on a court; swimming in a pool; running on a track; boxing in a ring; gymnastics in a gymnasium (gym).\nA stadium has a pitch surrounded by a track and stands. A sports complex groups several facilities. Equipment: goal posts, nets, a scoreboard, floodlights (lights for night matches).\nPeople: players, athletes, a coach, a referee, spectators, a groundsman (who looks after the pitch).",
  "checks": []
 },
